# Cloudflare Pages response headers (served from dist/_headers).
# No Strict-Transport-Security: none is sent today by the yapture.com zone or by this
# app (checked 2026-10-18). Turning HSTS on for *.apps.yapture.com is a zone-level
# operator decision, not something one Pages project should set alone.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'

/version.json
  Cache-Control: no-store
  Content-Type: application/json
